    "problems": "No power-law fits, exponents, or predictions are reported. The accuracy evidence is not a test of held-out pretraining-loss scaling; aggregate averages obscure variation across individual tasks. Table values do not state uncertainty, although the appendix says reported results use means and stderr. The UE-pool-size figure gives no numerical values in the text.",
    "rows_left_out": "Individual benchmark-task scores from Tables 1 and 2 are not separately rowed; the reported aggregate Avg is retained for each configuration to stay within the row limit and focus on general downstream performance. Figure 5's validation-loss curves are not rowed because they provide no numeric values and do not test a power-law loss relationship.",
